{"decisions":[{"id":"components.RequestModal.SearchByNameModal.showmore","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.RequestModal.SeasonEpisodeSelector.availabilityLegend","verdict":"correct","target":"Marca de verificación verde brillante: totalmente disponible. Marca de verificación verde oscuro: parcialmente disponible. X roja: no disponible.","confidence":"high","reason":"'Cheque' refers to a financial check; the UI element is a checkmark (marca de verificación). 'Rojo X' is unnatural; 'X roja' is the correct adjective placement."},{"id":"components.RequestModal.SeasonEpisodeSelector.clearAllEpisodes","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.RequestModal.SeasonEpisodeSelector.clearAllSeasons","verdict":"correct","target":"Limpiar todas las temporadas","confidence":"high","reason":"'Estaciones' means weather seasons or train stations; in the context of TV shows, 'temporadas' is the correct term."},{"id":"components.RequestModal.SeasonEpisodeSelector.clearEpisodeNumber","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.RequestModal.SeasonEpisodeSelector.clearSeasonNumber","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.RequestModal.SeasonEpisodeSelector.clearSpecials","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.RequestModal.SeasonEpisodeSelector.episode","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.RequestModal.SeasonEpisodeSelector.episodeNumber","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.RequestModal.SeasonEpisodeSelector.episodes","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.RequestModal.SeasonEpisodeSelector.loadError","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.RequestModal.SeasonEpisodeSelector.season","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.RequestModal.SeasonEpisodeSelector.seasonNumber","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.RequestModal.SeasonEpisodeSelector.selectAllEpisodes","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.RequestModal.SeasonEpisodeSelector.selectAllSeasons","verdict":"correct","target":"Seleccione todas las temporadas","confidence":"high","reason":"'Estaciones' is incorrect for TV seasons; 'temporadas' is the standard term."},{"id":"components.RequestModal.SeasonEpisodeSelector.selectEpisodeNumber","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.RequestModal.SeasonEpisodeSelector.selectSeason","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.RequestModal.SeasonEpisodeSelector.selectSeasonNumber","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.RequestModal.SeasonEpisodeSelector.selectSpecials","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.RequestModal.SeasonEpisodeSelector.specials","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.RequestModal.SeasonEpisodeSelector.title","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.RequestModal.SeasonEpisodeSelector.untitled","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.RequestModal.Sportarr.backendRequestFailed","verdict":"correct","target":"La solicitud fue guardada, pero Sportarr no pudo añadir esta liga. Revise la solicitud para obtener detalles y vuelva a intentarlo.","confidence":"high","reason":"'Salvada' is a calque of 'saved' (financial); 'guardada' is the correct term for data. 'Revise la solicitud de detalles' is ungrammatical; 'para obtener detalles' is natural."},{"id":"components.RequestModal.Sportarr.cancelError","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.RequestModal.Sportarr.cancelRequest","verdict":"correct","target":"Cancelar solicitud","confidence":"high","reason":"'Solicitud de cancelación' means 'cancellation request' (a request to cancel), whereas the source 'Cancel request' is an action to cancel the request itself."},{"id":"components.RequestModal.Sportarr.cancelSuccess","verdict":"correct","target":"La solicitud de {title} fue cancelada.","confidence":"high","reason":"Gender agreement: 'solicitud' is feminine, so 'cancelada' is required. The preposition 'de' is needed to link the title to the request."},{"id":"components.RequestModal.Sportarr.close","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.RequestModal.Sportarr.countryLabel","verdict":"keep"},{"id":"components.RequestModal.Sportarr.defaultService","verdict":"correct","target":"Predeterminado ({name})","confidence":"high","reason":"The target had a broken placeholder syntax